{"cast":"boardwalk","group":"game","bank":"game.ebbf81cdd3.bin","lines":[{"id":"game.intro.ones.01","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Ones at Venice Beach! First to eleven, make it take it. One ball, two hoopers, the whole boardwalk watching!","off":0,"len":27494,"sec":5.838},{"id":"game.intro.ones.02","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Straight up, one on one! First to eleven, make it take it. Venice, get loud!","off":27494,"len":21832,"sec":4.1},{"id":"game.intro.threes.01","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Threes at Venice Beach! Three on three, first to twenty-one, ninety seconds on the clock. Let's run!","off":49326,"len":26691,"sec":5.364},{"id":"game.intro.threes.02","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Six hoopers, one court, ninety seconds! First to twenty-one takes the sand. Drum circle, go!","off":76017,"len":27598,"sec":5.518},{"id":"game.check.01","moment":"game.check","text":"Their ball. Lock in, defense!","off":103615,"len":10788,"sec":1.466},{"id":"game.check.02","moment":"game.check","text":"Check it up! Get a stop!","off":114403,"len":9592,"sec":1.185},{"id":"game.check.03","moment":"game.check","text":"Defense, kid! Guard the boardwalk!","off":123995,"len":11888,"sec":1.67},{"id":"game.check.04","moment":"game.check","text":"Ball's checked. Nothing easy, Venice!","off":135883,"len":12867,"sec":1.862},{"id":"game.make.01","moment":"game.make","text":"Wet jumper!","off":148750,"len":8396,"sec":0.82},{"id":"game.make.02","moment":"game.make","text":"Pull-up, cash!","off":157146,"len":8038,"sec":0.892},{"id":"game.make.03","moment":"game.make","text":"Boardwalk approved!","off":165184,"len":9135,"sec":1.065},{"id":"game.make.04","moment":"game.make","text":"Jumper's pure!","off":174319,"len":8445,"sec":0.96},{"id":"game.make.05","moment":"game.make","text":"Buckets on the beach!","off":182764,"len":9289,"sec":1.093},{"id":"game.make.06","moment":"game.make","text":"Sweet shot, sneakers!","off":192053,"len":9884,"sec":1.189},{"id":"game.three.01","